%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh... Sorry, I'm completely at fault here. It's my first\ntime being responsible for third year students. I can\nbarely focus on anything else these days.\d%K%P
「啊、啊～…抱歉，是我不好。\n今年是我第一次教三年级，各种各样的事情搞得我时间很紧张，那个」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dI can understand that. You became a homeroom teacher for\na senior class in only your second year. As someone who\nstarted at the same time, I have nothing but respect for\nyou.\d%K%P
「这我倒是能理解。\n被聘用的第二年就开始当三年级的班主任了。\n作为同期录用的人，我十分佩服你，我也要努力了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dTh-Thank you, Mr. Matsumoto.\nWe might have started at the same time, but I'm...\d%K%P
「啊，谢谢你，松本老师。\n但虽说是同期录用的，但我已经…」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dI know all about your age and marriage history!\nAnd I'm perfectly okay with it!\d%K%P
