We couldn't exactly submit papers with suspect-looking\ninformation when her whole future depended on these exams.%K%P
这种『查看文件就会露馅的谎言』\n终究是不能堂而皇之地带进入学考试啊。%K%P
Although, given that I'd already covered all the bases to\nget help from the Sawashimas in case something came to\nlight -after- she got in, we were still walking a fine,\ngray line.%K%P
嘛，『先进去再说，之后就看泽嶋家的力量了』\n要是制订这样的作战方案，\n现在说不定会让她惹上受贿之嫌了。%K%P
