%LC理
\dDo you call that... a promotion?\nI'd rather say I was half-forced into it...\d%K%P
「这能称得上是升格么？\n基本上就是被强迫的…」%K%P
If she heard me calling her Mitoko again, I could safely\nexpect at least an hour-long lecture afterwards.%K%P
顺带一提，现在如果叫『美都子』这个称呼的话，\n就会被罚正座，被批评一个小时。%K%P
It might sound like a joke, but it was the truth... My\njoints still ached after sitting on my knees for such an\nextended period of time yesterday.%K%P
我倒希望这些事是我在说谎。\n不过昨天正座留在膝盖下的淤青还没好，所以我说的一点也没错。%K%P
