%LC麻实
\d...You truly do get along well.\d%K%P
「…关系真好啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI still grow emotional when I think about how far we've\ncome over the past six months. ...It might sound like an\nexaggeration for an outsider, but...\d%K%P
「想到半年前的事情就感慨万千。\n…现在回头去看当时也许有点小题大做了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt's not an exaggeration at all. I know how much you did\nfor her.\d%K%P
「不，不对。\n这些我都是知道的。\n理为了那孩子比谁都要努力」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's the other way around. She was the one who saved\n-me-.\d%K%P
