%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Making my comeback to society, being able to eat rice, and\nfinding my new goal in life... I had her to thank for all\nof that.%K%P
重返社会这事也是。\n吃得下米饭这事也是。\n拥有新的目标也是。%K%P
I also ended up befriending a number of eccentric but\nultimately well-meaning individuals through her.%K%P
开心愉快地和一帮稍微有点怪的人交朋友这事也是。%K%P
And if that wasn't enough, she also helped me rekindle my\nrelationship with someone from my past.%K%P
还有，和有些怀念的人\n再一次逐渐变得心意相通这事也是。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm so indebted to her I'll probably be unable to pay her\nback for the rest of my life. That's just how much she did\nfor me.\d%K%P
「大概用一辈子也还不清了。\n都子的恩情」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Talk about obsessive parents.\d%K%P
「…长辈是糊涂蛋也是件好事呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's not like that. She's simply just that great a\nperson. I respect her from the bottom of my heart.\d%K%P
「不是的。\n那个女孩是真的太与人为善了。\n…所以我才会尊敬她」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...I see.\d%K%P
「………是么」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
