『孩子有三个就好了』%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Eh?\d%K%P
「…诶？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dWill you... help us?\d%K%P
「您…要不要与我合作？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dW-Wait a second, Ms. Hasegawa. When you said you had\nsomething important to discuss, I thought it would be\nabout your education.\d%K%P
「等、等会长谷川同学。\n要说座谈会之前有什么大事，\n肯定是关于你的志愿…」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dOh, you don't need to worry about that. My plans haven't\nchanged at all.\d%K%P
「啊～，我的志愿您不用担心。\n正如我在调查表上所写，会朝着那个目标努力的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAre you sure you're just a student?\d%K%P
「…你真是学生么？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dI get that a lot, but I'm still living off my parents'\npaycheck, so you don't need to worry about it.\d%K%P
「别人也经常这么说我，\n不过我的确是靠父母养活的，请您放心」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYeah... Your parents seemed pretty normal when I met\nthem. At least I didn't get the image of anything close to\ninstability, debts, domestic violence, affairs, or\nunemployment when talking to them.\d%K%P
「这样的啊…\n跟你双亲见面的时候，他们都给人很普通的感觉，\n婚外情、欠债、家暴、衰败还有失业什么的，似乎都沾不上边」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dRight, how many of those did you say you had in your\nmarriage?\d%K%P
「那些事，老师您经历过多少呢？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
