「那个…一件、两…没有！\n至少当时是没有的」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dThen why did you get a divorce?\d%K%P
「那为什么要离婚？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dUh...\d%K%P
「唔…」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dYour husband didn't seem like a bad person. Just lacking\nin self-sufficiency to the extent that Toko's unable to\nleave him alone...\d%K%P
「您的前夫看起来也不是那么废柴的人。\n…还不至于废柴到必须得依赖都子的程度」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'm pretty sure I never said he was bad.\d%K%P
「废柴什么的…也不是一两句话就说得清的」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dBut I hear it's you who asked for a divorce. If you had\nno problems with affairs, debts, domestic violence,\nstability, or employment... then why?\d%K%P
「但是啊，提出要离婚的人是老师您吧？\n明明婚外情、欠债、家暴、衰败还有失业这些都不存在，\n您为什么要和他分手呢？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThat's... uh... it's...\nIf we're being honest, I didn't actually...\d%K%P
「那个…额，就是说…\n我，其实是…」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dYeah?\d%K%P
「嗯嗯…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...What are you trying to make me say?!\d%K%P
「………你究竟想让我说什么啊！？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dYou're so easy to lead on. I bet you would eventually end\nup agreeing to a marriage proposal from a man you didn't\neven like if he was persistent enough.\d%K%P
「老师真是个容易随波逐流的人呢。\n被不喜欢的男人执着地求婚，\n不知不觉就差点顺势点头同意了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dGah?! H-How much do you know...?!\d%K%P
「啊！？\n你、你是，你是从哪知道的…？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dNothing at all. I didn't expect you to react this way, to\nbe honest.\d%K%P
「我可没听过。\n刚才您反应真是出乎意料」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dI didn't even have to give you a shovel for you to start\ndigging your own grave.\nHow about you come clean to me already?\d%K%P
「…老师真是容易自掘坟墓呢～。\n好了，把话都说清楚了如何？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI can't. I'd fail as a teacher if I was -that- easy, you\nknow.\d%K%P
「不行。\n如此顺势被套出话了的话，\n作为一个老师，我也太没用了吧？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dYou can be a little inept as a teacher.\nPlenty of men prefer that, actually.\d%K%P
「没用的老师也挺好的。\n觉得那样子很可爱的男人，是有很多的哦？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI don't want to sound rude, but sometimes when I speak to\nyou, I almost feel like I'm the junior.\d%K%P
「虽然这么说也许很失礼，\n不过和你说话的时候，我时不时感觉我才是年龄小的一方…」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dYeah, you're still young, especially how easily you keep\ngetting swayed back and forth by everyone.\d%K%P
「嗯，老师很年轻哦。\n很容易引发周围人的关注或者受到牵连」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI can't deny that... but I promise I'll be more careful\nfrom now on. Anyway, I think we've had enough chatting for\ntoday. Be careful on your way home, Ms. Hasegawa.\d%K%P
「这我不否定…但以后我会注意的。\n今天就到这里吧。\n长谷川同学回家要注意安全哦」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dThat was good. Unfortunately for you... I can't give in\njust like that.\d%K%P
「很好。\n不过…这样是不行的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dUgh...\d%K%P
「唔唔…」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dYou're the best one for the role. In a sense, you have\nthe most influence over Toko right now.\d%K%P
「老师是最合适的人。\n各种意义上来说，现在的都子是最容易被影响的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dD-Do you really think that?\d%K%P
「你、你说这些是认真的么…？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dYeah. I want you to help Toko grow to be a bit more\nindependent from... your husband.\d%K%P
「嗯。\n我希望您让都子离开“父亲”而独立。\n…从老师您的前夫那里」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
