%LC理
\dCould it be... that you're tired?\d%K%P
「你是不是，累了？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEh? A-Ah... I'm sorry.\d%K%P
「诶？啊、啊啊…抱歉」%K%P
How many times has it been so far?%K%P
今天她已经是第几次走神了。%K%P
I was apparently the last person to come, so perhaps she\nhad a long day discussing all sorts of things with the\nother parents.%K%P
这是我要说的最后一件事了，\n志愿商谈就到此结束了吧？%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMaybe we should postpone this to some other day?\nWe can do it over a Saturday meal, like usual.\d%K%P
「那要不改天再谈？\n下周六一起吃个饭如何」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo, we're almost done, anyway.\nYou don't need to worry about me.\d%K%P
「不用了，差不多都已经完了。\n不用这么费心」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf you say so...\d%K%P
「那就好…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dBut... maybe we can still have dinner on Saturday. Just\nnot necessarily because of this.\d%K%P
「不过有另外的事可谈，\n周六的晚餐能劳烦你吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSure. I got paid last week, so I'll treat you this time.\d%K%P
「知道了。\n上个星期刚发工资了，偶尔我也请你吃一顿吧」%K%P
The fact we could casually invite each other to meet up\nwas proof that the old wall separating us had begun to\ncrumble away.%K%P
就像这样，\n彼此若无其事地作出约定，\n我觉得我们之间的疙瘩在逐渐解开。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dUm, anyway, about Mitoko's school of choice...\nYeah, I think we should go for a scholarship at Shuusen\nPreparatory.\d%K%P
「那个，关于志愿的事情…\n嗯，去争取秋泉大附的免费生资格吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Are you sure about it?\d%K%P
「…没问题么？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIn her case, it's not just her grades alone that make her\nan exemplary student. It's her attitude as well. I doubt\nanyone at the board meeting would be against it.\d%K%P
「以她的情况来看，不仅是学习成绩，\n平常的生活态度也受到大家的赞赏，\n我觉得资格评审团大概是提不出反对意见的吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-I see... That's good!\d%K%P
「是、是么…太好了」%K%P
We had already discussed this multiple times, but an\nofficial confirmation still made me a little emotional.%K%P
虽说事先我都已经调查清楚了，\n不过今天在此得到了保证后，我也算是松了口气。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dSo... in case she fails to get the scholarship...\nAre you sure you want her to go to that school?\d%K%P
