%LC理
\dYes. Just like we have discussed.\d%K%P
「嗯，那就拜托你了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Any idea how much it would cost?\d%K%P
「…你知道那要花多少钱么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAbout three months' worth of my salary... I think.\d%K%P
「我三个月的工资…差不多？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Me and Himeo had to actually half-force Mitoko to write\nthat in her second choice cell.%K%P
实际上，对于这第二志愿，\n都子是想拒绝的，不过被我和姬绪小姐强行加上了。%K%P
Shuusen Preparatory was a female academy offering full\nexemption from tuition fees to scholarship students, as\none would expect from such a well-respected local\ninstitution.%K%P
对特招生完全免除学费、财大气粗的秋泉大附，\n不愧是本地有名的大小姐学校。%K%P
It covered the examinations fees, the entrance fees, the\nlecture fees, the mandatory donations, and so on. It was\non a whole other level from public schools, or even most\nprivate ones.%K%P
考试费，入学费，学费，住宿费，以及种种别的费用…\n不要说跟公立学校比，就是跟其他的私立学校相比，\n也是足以让父母赚足面子的…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's going to be okay! I should be better off by next\nsummer!\d%K%P
「没关系！\n到明年夏天钱就应该都能攒够了」%K%P
Yet we still decided on Shuusen Preparatory and nothing\nelse.%K%P
就算这样，我也是铁了心要让都子去秋泉大附。%K%P
It was mostly because I saw how excited Mitoko was when\nHimeo showed us around campus.%K%P
